## Docsum Microservice Settings
DOCSUM_DEFAULT_SUMMARY_TYPE="map_reduce" # Possible values: "map_reduce", "refine"
DOCSUM_LLM_USVC_ENDPOINT="http://localhost:9000/v1"

DOCSUM_MAX_CONCURRENCY=16

## Model context length in tokens, used to pre-validate 'stuff' requests. Leave unset to
## read it from the LLM's /v1/models, which reports it only when the LLM microservice
## talks to the model server directly (an AI gateway in between does not).
#DOCSUM_MODEL_CONTEXT_LENGTH=8192

## Uncomment to change the microservice port
#DOCSUM_USVC_PORT=9001

## Uncomment to change the microservice log level
# ERAG_LOGGER_LEVEL=INFO
